{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fish Season</strong> is a casual fishing game where you catch fish and battle rival fishermen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The fishing season is open, and everyone is competing for the most profitable catches. In <strong>Fish Season</strong>, fish are everything\u2014the entire game runs on a fish-based economy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sail to the dock for quick and useful upgrades. And when you're in trouble, fire some fish at your enemies\u2014just try not to make too much of a mess, okay?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and don\u2019t forget to collect the spoils from your sunken foes!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602600/extras/Banner.png?t=1749550004\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602600?t=1749550004","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602600/b63d4ced8b13a387ed9778d5827579d21f8d59e2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749550004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602600/029f60eebfa6278ee6cb9e8060a35cd7b3425696/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749550004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602600/029f60eebfa6278ee6cb9e8060a35cd7b3425696/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749550004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fish Season</strong> is a casual fishing game where you catch fish and battle rival fishermen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The 